{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Sites.NonabelianCohomology.H1","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Group"],"declarations":31,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.isCoboundary_pull","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.isCoboundary_pull","kind":"theorem","line":321,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L321-L327","doc":"**Vanishing is preserved by refinement.** If the obstruction is a coboundary\non the cover `U`, its pullback to a refinement `V` is a coboundary there. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.isCoboundary_obstruction_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.isCoboundary_obstruction_iff","kind":"theorem","line":313,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L313-L319","doc":"**The vanishing of the obstruction class does not depend on the local\nlift.** Both sides are equivalent to the existence of a lift of `γ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.IsCoboundary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.IsCoboundary","kind":"def","line":307,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L307-L311","doc":"A 2-cochain of `𝒜` is a **coboundary** if it is `α_ij α_jk α_ik⁻¹` for a\n1-cochain `α` of `𝒜`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.exists_lift_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.exists_lift_iff","kind":"theorem","line":257,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L257-L305","doc":"**Lifting criterion.** The `𝒢`-cocycle `γ` lifts to an `𝓔`-cocycle iff its\nobstruction (relative to the local lift `ξ`) is a coboundary. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_pull","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_pull","kind":"theorem","line":245,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L245-L255","doc":"**Compatibility with refinement.** Pulling `γ` and its local lift `ξ` back\nalong a refinement of the cover pulls the obstruction back. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_lift_change","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_lift_change","kind":"theorem","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L208-L243","doc":"**Independence of the local lift.** Two local lifts `ξ`, `ξ'` of `γ` give\nobstructions that differ by the coboundary of a 1-cochain of `𝒜`, so the class\nof the obstruction does not depend on the choice. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_cocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_cocycle","kind":"theorem","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L199-L206","doc":"**The obstruction is a 2-cocycle.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_spec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction_spec","kind":"theorem","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L191-L197","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.obstruction","kind":"def","line":182,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L182-L189","doc":"The obstruction 2-cochain of `γ` relative to the local lift `ξ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.defect_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.defect_mem","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtensionObstruction.lean#L177-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CentralExtension.PresheafCentralExtension.comm","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/PresheafCentralExtens